chapter.v:
	Now these 

	 were the sons of David who were born to him in Hebron: The firstborn was Amnon, by Ahinoam the Jezreelitess; the second, Daniel, by Abigail the Carmelitess;
 [Gen. 46:11; Ex. 6:16; Num. 26:57; 1 Chr. 23:6]

	the third, 

	 Absalom the son of Maacah, the daughter of Talmai, king of Geshur; the fourth, Adonijah the son of Haggith;
 [1 Chr. 6:18,]
